// TURBULENCE SENSITIVITY CASE val25_clr50_40ms_tu05: identical to
// val25_clr50_40ms (mesh, schemes, U = 40 m/s) except the inlet turbulence.
// Target at the nose: Tu = 0.5 %, nut/nu = 20 (the baseline is 0.25 %, 10).
// Tu and the viscosity ratio change TOGETHER: at nut/nu = 10 the highest
// reachable nose Tu is 0.38 % (omega_nose is capped at 1/(beta*t) = 231 1/s by
// the free-stream decay over 2.088 m), so a higher Tu forces a higher ratio.
// k0, omega0 are INLET values (SST decay beta = 0.0828, beta* = 0.09); to be
// verified by sampling the solution at the nose.
flowVelocity         (40 0 0);
pressure             0;
turbulentKE          0.52657;
turbulentOmega       1475.3;
